# AdminDashboardController — com.asrevo.cvhome.uaa.web.admin
#
# The overview screen in one read: what happened over the range, and what the realm's own data says
# about how it is configured. Every number is counted from a table rather than kept as a statistic.
# Addressed through store-core-gateway (`/uaa/**`).
#
# Behind SCOPE_super_admin / ROLE_SUPER_ADMIN. Requires a running stack: lcl start -d

### the last 24 hours — 200 Dashboard
# signIns[] is one bucket per hour (per day for the longer ranges) with successes and failures side by
# side; posture[] is computed per request — a key older than its rotation interval, accounts with no
# password, authorization-code clients without PKCE, secrets expiring within 30 days, breached-password
# checking off, more failed sign-ins than the lockout threshold.
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/uaa/api/v1/admin/dashboard?range=24h
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{SUPER_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}

### a week, bucketed by day — 200
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/uaa/api/v1/admin/dashboard?range=7d
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{SUPER_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}

### a month — 200; an unknown range falls back to 24h rather than failing
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/uaa/api/v1/admin/dashboard?range=30d
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{SUPER_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}

### as an org admin — 403
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/uaa/api/v1/admin/dashboard
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}
